.nh
.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
orbit-migrate - Run and inspect workspace state migrations


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit migrate [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Executes pending workspace migrations and tracks applied state in .orbit/migrations.json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for migrate

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Print the result as a JSON envelope


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBorbit(1)\fP, \fBorbit-migrate-status(1)\fP
